  "title": "Formal symbol manipulation has syntax but no semantics",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "ab33cecd-d3d4-45e8-9e53-10584b43ed7f",
      "text": "Formal symbol manipulations have no intentionality by themselves. They are not even symbol manipulations, since the symbols stand for nothing to the system: they have a syntax but no semantics.",
